    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾰγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not firm</i> or <i>stiff,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖλοι ἀπαγέες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.61
				</span></i>
			;  of water, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀσύστατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.949b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.677
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστοῦν ἔτι ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.27.5
			</span></i>; of flesh, <i>flabby,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.191
			</span></i>.</div>
